title: The Death of Hermann Müller
view-if: year = 1931 and month >= 3
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
tags: event
go-to: pm if chancellor = "Müller"; not_pm if chancellor != "Müller"
on-arrival: muller_dead = 1; n_advisors -= 1 if muller_advisor == 1; muller_advisor = 0;

@pm
on-arrival: muller_died_in_office = 1
# TODO: achievement for muller dying in office

Chancellor Hermann Müller has died while in office. He will be greatly missed. But now, a new Chancellor must be picked. Perhaps we can convince the SPD to let the Chancellory to fall to us?

- @braun_chancellor: Otto Braun (SPD) for Chancellor.
- @wels_chancellor: The SPD appoints Otto Wels for Chancellor.
- @breitscheid_chancellor: Rudolf Breitscheid (SPD) for Chancellor.
- @bruning_chancellor: Convince them to allow Heinrich Bruning to become Chancellor.
- @wirth_chancellor: Convince them that Joseph Wirth should be Chancellor.
- @adenauer_chancellor: Persuade the SPD to allow us to appoint Konrad Adenauer as Chancellor.

@braun_chancellor
on-arrival: chancellor = "Braun"; chancellor_party = "SPD"; spd_relation += 2;
view-if: spd_relation < 40
subtitle: The SPD are making moves to consolidate the power they have...

Despite our subtle protestations, the SPD have appointed Otto Braun, Minister-President of Prussia, Chancellor. This is slightly worrying.


@wels_chancellor
on-arrival: chancellor = "Wels"; chancellor_party = "SPD"; spd_relation += 3;
view-if: spd_relation >= 40
subtitle: He is essentially a continuation of Müller's cabinet. 

The SPD is grateful to us for supporting Wels as Chancellor.

@adenauer_chancellor
on-arrival: chancellor = "Adenauer"; chancellor_party = "Z"; spd_relation -= 5; kpd_relation += 1
subtitle: The SPD is worried about his anti-Prussian tendencies.

Our coalition partners are reluctant to accept the new Chancellor, but they do not make loud objections.

@bruning_chancellor
on-arrival: chancellor = "Brüning"; chancellor_party = "Z"; spd_relation -= 3; dvp_relation += 5
subtitle: Surely by now it is our turn?

The SPD grumbles, but eventually they acquiesce to a Brüning Chancellory.

@wirth_chancellor
on-arrival: chancellor = "Wirth"; chancellor_party = "Z"; spd_relation -= 2; dvp_relation += 2
view-if: z_party_leader = "Joos"
subtitle: As a moderate member of our, he could represent unity.

Our coalition partners accept Joseph Wirth of the Center Party as the new Chancellor.



@not_pm

Herman Müller, one of the SPD's long-time leaders, has died. He was always open to cooperation with us, and despite his despicable atheism, he will still be missed by many. 
